div class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-dnmrzs r-1udh08x r-1udbk01 r-3s2u2q r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1b43r93 r-1cwl3u0"></span></div></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-obd0qt r-1cmwbt1 r-11niif6 r-qn3fzs r-3pj75a r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1habvwh r-18u37iz r-1w6e6rj r-1cmwbt1 r-1x5uudt r-15zivkp r-dnmrzs"></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-18u37iz r-1w6e6rj r-17s6mgv r-dnmrzs"><div tabindex="0" class="css-g5y9jx r-1loqt21 r-1otgn73" style="width: 180px; height: auto; outline: none;"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1sw30gj r-1q9bdsx r-1udh08x r-bnwqim r-10m9thr r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1mlwlqe r-1udh08x r-aqfbo4 r-n1ft60 r-gf0ln r-agouwx r-bnwqim r-13qz1uu r-l13dpy" style="aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1niwhzg r-vvn4in r-u6sd8q r-1p0dtai r-1pi2tsx r-1d2f490 r-u8s1d r-zchlnj r-ipm5af r-13qz1uu r-1wyyakw r-4gszlv" style="filter: brightness(1); background-image: url(&quot;https://ton.x.com/i/ton/data/grok-attachment/2095282801620795395&quot;);"></div><img alt="" draggable="false" class="css-9pa8cd" src="./gorro_files/2095282801620795395"></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1habvwh r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-9aw3ui r-1she8f3 r-17s6mgv r-u8s1d r-o9xkwf"></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1habvwh r-18u37iz r-9aw3ui r-17s6mgv r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-1sw30gj r-1fuqb1j r-1ssbvtb r-zmhzs6 r-11f147o r-3pj75a"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-16dba41 r-imh66m r-1kt6imw r-dnmrzs" style="color: rgb(15, 20, 25);"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: block;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1x3r274 r-p1pxzi" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Todavía no ha quedado cm quiero en la pantalla completa como la del frigon</span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-16lk18l r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1wbh5a2 r-11niif6 r-bnwqim r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-nhe8su r-yn5ncy r-clrlgt r-1niwhzg r-jusfrs r-1udh08x r-q8lnzb"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: none;"></div></div><div class="css-g5y9jx r-3pj75a"><div dir="ltr" class="css-146c3p1 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-37j5jr r-rjixqe r-16dba41 r-imh66m" style="color: rgb(15, 20, 25);"><div class="css-g5y9jx" style="display: block;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">Entiendo, todavía no está a pantalla completa. Vamos a solucionarlo de forma más fuerte.</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1adg3ll r-1g7jtus r-1x3r274" style="direction: ltr;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">El problema es que el carrusel se está quedando pequeño (solo una franja). Aquí tienes la solución completa y más potente:</span></span></span></span><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-adyw6z r-135wba7 r-b88u0q" style="display: block; direction: ltr; margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0.5em;"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1x3r274"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">1. CSS definitivo (borra lo anterior del carrusel y pega esto)</span></span></span></span><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1adg3ll r-ag158w r-dnmrzs r-1yx7oqi r-13qz1uu"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-dnmrzs r-1adg3ll r-13qz1uu" data-testid="markdown-code-block"><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-bqz1g2 r-iimx8d r-10ergbs r-6413gk r-43g30s r-l4nmg1 r-o59np7 r-2dysd3 r-vmopo1 r-13qz1uu r-gtdqiz r-1fhadnw r-184en5c"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-1aiqnjv r-n6v787"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3">css</span></span><div class="css-g5y9jx r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-z5qs1h r-17s6mgv"><button aria-label="Copy to clipboard" role="button" class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5 r-sdzlij r-1phboty r-rs99b7 r-lrvibr r-1ceczpf r-lp5zef r-1loqt21 r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l" type="button" style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-q4m81j r-b88u0q r-1awozwy r-6koalj r-18u37iz r-16y2uox r-bcqeeo r-1777fci" style="color: rgb(15, 20, 25);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="r-4qtqp9 r-yyyyoo r-dnmrzs r-bnwqim r-lrvibr r-m6rgpd r-10ptun7 r-1janqcz" style="color: rgb(15, 20, 25);"><g><path d="M19.5 2C20.88 2 22 3.12 22 4.5v11c0 1.21-.86 2.22-2 2.45V4.5c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5H6.05c.23-1.14 1.24-2 2.45-2h11zm-4 4C16.88 6 18 7.12 18 8.5v11c0 1.38-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5h-11C3.12 22 2 20.88 2 19.5v-11C2 7.12 3.12 6 4.5 6h11zM4 19.5c0 .28.22.5.5.5h11c.28 0 .5-.22.5-.5v-11c0-.28-.22-.5-.5-.5h-11c-.28 0-.5.22-.5.5v11z"></path></g></svg><div class="css-g5y9jx r-xoduu5"><span class="css-1jxf684 r-dnmrzs r-1udh08x r-1udbk01 r-3s2u2q r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1b43r93 r-1cwl3u0" style="border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(15, 20, 25);"></span></div></span></button></div></div><pre style="background: rgb(247, 249, 249); color: rgb(56, 58, 66); font-family: monospace; direction: ltr; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.3; tab-size: 2; hyphens: none; padding: 12px; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em 0.3em 8px 8px; font-size: 13px; display: block; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;"><code class="language-css" style="background: rgb(250, 250, 250); color: rgb(56, 58, 66); font-family: &quot;Fira Code&quot;, &quot;Fira Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, monospace; direction: ltr; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 2; hyphens: none;"><span class="token" style="color: rgb(160, 161, 167); font-style: italic;">/* ===== CARRUSEL PANTALLA COMPLETA (versión fuerte) ===== */</span><span>
</span><span></span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(80, 161, 79);">html, body</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">{</span><span>
</span><span>  </span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(228, 86, 73);">margin</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">:</span><span> 0</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">;</span><span>
</span><span>  </span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(228, 86, 73);">padding</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">:</span><span> 0</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">;</span><span>
</span><span>  </span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(228, 86, 73);">height</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">:</span><span> 100%</span><span class="token" style="color: rgb(56, 58, 66);">;</span><span>
